{
  "id": "RAW_6982870a",
  "title": "Organic Maps：离线徒步、骑行、步道与导航",
  "url": "https://organicmaps.app/",
  "date": "2026-07-05 22:14:30",
  "author": "Hacker News",
  "siteName": "Hacker News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <main>\n   <p><strong>Organic Maps</strong> is a privacy-focused offline maps &amp; GPS app for hiking, cycling, biking, and driving. Absolutely free. No ads. No tracking. Developed with love by the open-source community and the same people, who created <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Maps.Me\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maps.me\"><strong>MapsWithMe</strong></a>/<strong>Maps.Me</strong> app. Powered by <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"OpenStreetMap\" href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/about\">OpenStreetMap</a> data.</p>\n   <p><strong>Organic Maps</strong> is one of the few applications nowadays that supports 100% of features without an active Internet connection. Install Organic Maps, download maps, throw away your SIM card, and go for a weeklong trip on a single battery charge without any byte sent to the network.</p>\n   <blockquote>\n    <p>In December 2025, Organic Maps <a href=\"https://organicmaps.app/news/2025-12-31/organic-maps-2025-year-in-review/\">reached 6M installs</a>. <a href=\"https://organicmaps.app/donate/\">Help us</a> to scale!</p>\n   </blockquote>\n   <h3 id=\"install\">Download and install Organic Maps from <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from the AppStore\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/organic-maps/id1567437057\">AppStore</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from Google Play\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.organicmaps&amp;hl=en\">Google Play</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from Huawei AppGallery\" href=\"https://appgallery.huawei.com/#/app/C104325611?local=en\">Huawei AppGallery</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps from GitHub Releases\" href=\"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/wiki/Installing-Organic-Maps-from-GitHub-using-Obtainium\">Obtainium</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps in Accrescent\" href=\"https://accrescent.app/app/app.organicmaps\">Accrescent</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from F-Droid\" href=\"https://f-droid.org/en/packages/app.organicmaps/\">FDroid</a></h3>\n   <p><span class=\"badge\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/organic-maps/id1567437057\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from the AppStore\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/badges/apple-appstore.svg\" alt=\"Install Organic Maps from the AppStore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></span> <span class=\"badge\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.organicmaps&amp;hl=en\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from Google Play\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/badges/googleplay.svg\" alt=\"Install Organic Maps from Google Play\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></span> <span class=\"badge\"><a href=\"https://appgallery.huawei.com/#/app/C104325611?local=en\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from Huawei AppGallery\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/badges/huawei-appgallery.svg\" alt=\"Install Organic Maps from Huawei AppGallery\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></span> <span class=\"badge\"><a href=\"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/wiki/Installing-Organic-Maps-from-GitHub-using-Obtainium\" title=\"Organic Maps from GitHub Releases\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/badges/obtainium.svg\" alt=\"Install Organic Maps via Obtainium\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></span> <span class=\"badge\"><a href=\"https://f-droid.org/en/packages/app.organicmaps/\" title=\"Install Organic Maps from F-Droid\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/badges/f-droid.svg\" alt=\"Install Organic Maps from F-Droid\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></span></p>\n   <img class=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/screenshots/hiking.jpg\" alt=\"Hiking\" title=\"Hiking\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\"> <img class=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/screenshots/prague.jpg\" alt=\"Prague\" title=\"Prague\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <img class=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/screenshots/search.jpg\" alt=\"Offline Search\" title=\"Offline Search\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <img class=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/screenshots/dark.jpg\" alt=\"Navigation in dark mode\" title=\"Navigation in dark mode\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n   <h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n   <p>Organic Maps is the ultimate companion app for travelers, tourists, hikers, drivers, and cyclists:</p>\n   <ul>\n    <li>Detailed offline maps with places that don't exist on other maps, thanks to <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"OpenStreetMap\" href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/about\">OpenStreetMap</a></li>\n    <li>Cycling routes, hiking trails, and walking paths</li>\n    <li>Contour lines, elevation profiles, peaks, and slopes</li>\n    <li>Turn-by-turn walking, cycling, and car navigation with voice guidance and CarPlay/Android Auto support</li>\n    <li>Metro/subway maps</li>\n    <li>Fast offline search on the downloaded maps</li>\n    <li>Import or export bookmarks in KML/KMZ, GPX, GeoJSON formats</li>\n    <li>Dark Mode to protect your eyes</li>\n    <li>Countries and regions don't take a lot of space</li>\n    <li>Wikipedia articles for popular places</li>\n    <li>Free and open-source</li>\n   </ul>\n   <h2 id=\"why-organic\">Why Organic?</h2>\n   <p>Organic Maps is pure and organic, made with love:</p>\n   <ul>\n    <li>Respects your privacy</li>\n    <li>Saves your battery</li>\n    <li>No unexpected mobile data charges</li>\n   </ul>\n   <p>Organic Maps app is free from trackers and other bad stuff:</p>\n   <ul>\n    <li>No ads</li>\n    <li>No tracking</li>\n    <li>No data collection</li>\n    <li>No phoning home</li>\n    <li>No annoying registration</li>\n    <li>No mandatory tutorials</li>\n    <li>No noisy email spam</li>\n    <li>No push notifications</li>\n    <li>No crapware</li>\n    <li>\n     <del>No pesticides</del>\n     Purely organic!\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <p>The application is verified by <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://reports.exodus-privacy.eu.org/en/reports/app.organicmaps/latest/\">Exodus Privacy Project</a>:</p>\n   <img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/privacy/exodus.png\" alt=\"Exodus Privacy verified Organic Maps app\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n   <p>The iOS application is verified by <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ios.trackercontrol.org/analysis/app.organicmaps\">TrackerControl for iOS</a>:</p>\n   <img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/privacy/trackercontrol.png\" alt=\"TrackerControl for iOS verified Organic Maps app\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n   <p>Organic Maps doesn't request excessive permissions to spy on you:</p>\n   <img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/privacy/om.jpg\" alt=\"Permissions requested by the Organic Maps app\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> <img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/privacy/mm.jpg\" alt=\"Permissions requested by the Maps.me app for comparison\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n   <p>At Organic Maps, we believe that privacy is a fundamental human right:</p>\n   <ul>\n    <li>Organic Maps is an indie community-driven open-source project</li>\n    <li>We protect your privacy from Big Tech's prying eyes</li>\n    <li>Stay safe no matter wherever you are</li>\n   </ul>\n   <p>Reject surveillance - embrace your freedom.</p>\n   <p><strong><a href=\"https://organicmaps.app/#install\">Give Organic Maps a try!</a></strong></p>\n   <h2 id=\"who-is-paying-for-the-free-app\">Who is paying for the free app?</h2>\n   <p>The app is free for everyone. Please <a href=\"https://organicmaps.app/donate/\">donate</a> to support us!</p>\n   <p>To donate conveniently, click on your preferred payment method icon below:</p>\n   <div class=\"donate_buttons\">\n    <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"Credit/Debit Card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/visa_mc.svg\" alt=\"Credit/Debit Card\"></a> <a href=\"https://wise.com/pay/business/organicmapsou?Donate%20to%20support%20Organic%20Maps%20project\" title=\"Wise\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/wise.svg\" alt=\"Wise\"></a> <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"Apple Pay\" id=\"applePay\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/apple.svg\" alt=\"Apple Pay\"></a> <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"Google Pay\" id=\"googlePay\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/google.svg\" alt=\"Google Pay\"></a>\n    <form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/donate\" method=\"post\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"PayPal\">\n     <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hosted_button_id\" value=\"JYM34AADM87V8\"> <input type=\"image\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/donates/paypal.svg\" name=\"submit\" title=\"Donate to Organic Maps using PayPal\" alt=\"Donate with PayPal button\">\n    </form>\n    <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"iDeal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/ideal.svg\" alt=\"iDeal\"></a> <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"SEPA\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/sepa.svg\" alt=\"SEPA\"></a> <a href=\"https://organicmaps.app/donate#bank-transfer\" title=\"Bank Transfer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/bank.svg\" alt=\"Bank Transfer\"></a> <a href=\"https://liberapay.com/OrganicMaps\" title=\"LiberaPay\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/liberapay.svg\" alt=\"LiberaPay\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/organicmaps/\" title=\"GitHub Sponsors\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub Sponsors\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/OrganicMaps\" title=\"Patreon\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"https://opencollective.com/organicmaps\" title=\"OpenCollective\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/opencollective.svg\" alt=\"OpenCollective\"></a> <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"BanContact\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/bancontact.svg\" alt=\"BanContact\"></a> <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"EPS\"><img id=\"eps\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/eps.svg\" alt=\"EPS\"></a> <a href=\"https://donate.organicmaps.app\" title=\"MB Way/Multibanko\"><img id=\"multibanco\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/multibanco.svg\" alt=\"MB Way/Multibanko\"></a> <a href=\"https://organicmaps.app/donate#crypto\" title=\"Bitcoin, Ethereum, Monero, Tron, ZCash and other crypto\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://organicmaps.app/images/donates/bitcoin.svg\" alt=\"Bitcoin, Ethereum, Monero, Tron, ZCash and other crypto\"></a>\n   </div>\n   <p>Beloved institutional sponsors below have provided targeted grants to cover some infrastructure costs and fund development of new selected features:</p>\n   <table style=\"border-spacing: 20px\">\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td><a href=\"https://nlnet.nl/\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/sponsors/nlnet.svg\" alt=\"The NLnet Foundation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/milestone/7\">The Search &amp; Fonts improvement project</a> has been <a href=\"https://nlnet.nl/project/OrganicMaps/\">funded</a> through NGI0 Entrust Fund. <a href=\"https://nlnet.nl/entrust/\">NGI0 Entrust Fund</a> is established by the <a href=\"https://nlnet.nl/\">NLnet Foundation</a> with financial support from the European Commission's <a href=\"https://www.ngi.eu/\">Next Generation Internet programme</a>, under the aegis of DG Communications Networks, Content and Technology under grant agreement No 101069594.</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td><a href=\"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/sponsors/gsoc.svg\" alt=\"Google Summer of Code\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/\">Google</a> backed student's projects in the Google Summer of Code program during <a href=\"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/programs/2022/organizations/organic-maps\">2022</a>, <a href=\"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/programs/2023/organizations/organic-maps\">2023</a>, <a href=\"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/programs/2024/organizations/organic-maps\">2024</a>, <a href=\"https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/programs/2025/organizations/organic-maps\">2025</a> programs. Noteworthy projects included Android Auto, Wikipedia Dump Extractor, Track Recording for Android.</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.mythic-beasts.com/\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/sponsors/mythic-beasts.png\" alt=\"Mythic Beasts\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.mythic-beasts.com/\">Mythic Beasts</a> ISP <a href=\"https://www.mythic-beasts.com/blog/2021/10/06/improving-the-world-bit-by-expensive-bit/\">provides us</a> two virtual servers with up to 400 TB/month of free bandwidth to host and serve maps downloads and updates.</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td><a href=\"https://44plus.vn\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/sponsors/44plus.svg\" alt=\"44+ Technologies\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://44plus.vn\">44+ Technologies</a> is <a href=\"https://44plus.vn/organicmaps\">providing us </a>with a free dedicated server worth around $12,000/year to serve maps across Vietnam &amp; Southeast Asia.</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td><a href=\"https://futo.org\"><img src=\"https://organicmaps.app/sponsors/futo.svg\" alt=\"FUTO\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://futo.org\">FUTO</a> has <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fJJclgBHrEw\">awarded $1000 micro-grant</a> to Organic Maps in February 2023.</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n   <h2 id=\"community\">Community</h2>\n   <p>Organic Maps is an <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps\">open-source software</a> licensed under the Apache License 2.0.</p>\n   <ul>\n    <li>Please join our beta program, suggest your features, and report bugs:\n     <ul>\n      <li><a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://testflight.apple.com/join/lrKCl08I\">iOS Beta (TestFlight)</a></li>\n      <li><a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://appdistribution.firebase.dev/i/f3e918f9abc40c9c\">Android Beta (Firebase)</a></li>\n      <li><a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/details/app.organicmaps.desktop\">Linux Desktop Beta (Flatpak)</a></li>\n      <li><a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://repology.org/project/organicmaps/versions\">Linux Desktop Beta (packages)</a></li>\n     </ul></li>\n    <li>Report bugs or issues to <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues\">the issue tracker</a> or <a href=\"https://organicmaps.app/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a0d3d5d0d0cfd2d4e0cfd2c7c1cec9c3cdc1d0d38ec1d0d0\">email us</a>.</li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/discussions/categories/ideas\">Discuss</a> ideas or propose feature requests.</li>\n    <li>Subscribe to our <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps news\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsApp\">Telegram Channel</a> or to the <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps on the Matrix\" href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#organicmaps:matrix.org\">matrix space</a> for updates.</li>\n    <li>Join our <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps chat\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMaps\">Telegram Group</a> to discuss with other users.</li>\n    <li>Visit our <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps\">GitHub page</a>.</li>\n    <li>Follow our updates in <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FOSStodon\" href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@organicmaps\">FOSStodon</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://facebook.com/OrganicMaps\">Facebook</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/OrganicMapsApp\">Twitter</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://instagram.com/organicmaps.app/\">Instagram</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps on Bluesky\" href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/organicmaps.bsky.social\">Bluesky</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps on Threads\" href=\"https://www.threads.net/@organicmaps\">Threads</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/organicmaps/\">Reddit</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/organic-maps/\">LinkedIn</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps on TikTok\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@organicmaps\">TikTok</a>.</li>\n    <li>Join local communities: <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#organicmapstranslate_hu:matrix.org\">Hungarian Matrix room</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps-Chat\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsDeutsch\">German-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"有机地图聊天\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsZh\">Chinese-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Discussion sur les Organic Maps\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsFr\">French-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Chat di Organic Maps\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsIt\">Italian-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Chat de Organic Maps\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsEs\">Spanish-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps чат\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsRu\">Russian-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps чат\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsUa\">Ukrainian-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps المحادثة\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsAr\">Arabic-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps گفتگو\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsPersian\">Persian-</a>, <a rel=\"noopener external\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Organic Maps'la sohbet et\" href=\"https://t.me/OrganicMapsTr\">Turkish-</a>speaking Telegram chats.</li>\n   </ul>\n   <!-- BEGIN OF GOOGLE NATIVE APP PROMPT -->\n   <!-- https://developers.google.com/web/fundamentals/app-install-banners/native -->\n   <button id=\"addPWA\" class=\"installPWAButton\">Install Organic Maps from Google Play</button>\n   <!-- END OF GOOGLE NATIVE APP PROMPT -->\n  </main>\n  <!-- Cloudflare Pages Analytics -->\n  <!-- Cloudflare Pages Analytics -->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Organic Maps 是一款免费、开源、注重隐私的离线地图应用，支持徒步、骑行和驾车导航，基于 OpenStreetMap 数据构建，并获隐私项目认证。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Organic Maps 是一款免费、开源、注重隐私的离线地图应用，支持徒步、骑行和驾车导航，基于 OpenStreetMap 数据构建，并获隐私项目认证。",
  "summary": "这是 Organic Maps 的官方主页，一款开源离线导航应用，强调隐私保护、零追踪以及无需联网的完整功能。页面详细介绍了其功能特性，包括详细的离线地图、徒步与骑行步道、等高线、逐向导航、地铁线路图以及书签导入导出。页面还阐述了该应用的有机理念（无广告、无追踪、无数据收集）、通过捐赠和机构赞助维持的资金模式，以及社区参与方式。同时提供了安装链接，以及来自 Exodus Privacy 和 TrackerControl 的认证信息。虽然功能和优势罗列全面，但内容偏向推广性质，分析深度有限。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Organic Maps 是一款以隐私为核心的离线地图应用，无广告、无追踪。",
      "explanation": "该应用已通过 Exodus Privacy 和 TrackerControl 认证，且不会请求过多权限，是注重隐私用户的理想选择。"
    },
    {
      "point": "基于 OpenStreetMap 数据提供详细的离线地图，包括徒步步道、骑行路线和等高线。",
      "explanation": "该应用支持步行、骑行和驾车的逐向导航，提供语音引导和 CarPlay / Android Auto 支持，全部无需联网。"
    },
    {
      "point": "该项目开源且由社区驱动，通过捐赠和机构资助维持运营。",
      "explanation": "页面列出了 NLnet Foundation、Google Summer of Code 和 Mythic Beasts 等赞助方，并邀请用户通过多个捐赠平台贡献力量。"
    },
    {
      "point": "应用的「有机」理念延伸至用户体验：无需注册、无推送通知、无数据收集。",
      "explanation": "页面将其与典型的充斥追踪的应用形成对比，将隐私定位为一项基本权利。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "尊重你的隐私",
    "我们相信隐私是一项基本人权",
